ut journey times and boost connectivity to Puerto Banús, Marbella, and beyond.\n\nThis is a rare chance to ‌secure ‌a ‌top-tier ‌plot ‌in ‌a setting ‌where natural ‌beauty, future growth and world-class ‌amenities ‌come ‌together. ‌An ‌incredible opportunity to build, ‌invest, ‌or ‌simply ‌live ‌an ‌incredible ‌life!"},"features":{"es":["Cerca de Golf","Urbanización","Sur","Nueva Construcción","Privada","Mar","Montaña","Golf","Campo","Panorámicas","Golf","Lujo","Pre-construcción","Con Permiso de Planificación","Contemporáneo"],"en":["Close To Golf","Urbanisation","South","New Construction","Private","Sea","Mountain","Golf","Country","Panoramic","Golf","Luxury","Off Plan","With Planning Permission","Contemporary"]},"piscina":true,"parking":false,"jardin":false,"estado":"Available"}